    <node id="Obsidian">
      <data key="d0">Obsidian</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Obsidian is a personal knowledge management system that allows users to capture, store, and connect information in a digital vault, with features such as version control using git, AI-searchable capabilities, and synchronization through GitHub.&lt;SEP&gt;A personal knowledge management and note-taking app.&lt;SEP&gt;A note-taking and knowledge management application.</data>
